Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:22.59,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}やめちゃえって思うのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:25.93,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}逃げ出すことさえできなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:29.60,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}フラフラ、フラフラ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:33.39,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自信が無くてそのせいで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.77,0:23:37.35,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自分自身も出せなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:40.82,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自信無くしてスパイラル
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.40,0:23:44.53,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}グルグル、グルグル
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.11,0:23:50.87,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}でも出逢えたから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.49,0:23:57.71,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}もう見失わないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:24:00.46,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}笑顔があれば、
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:02.13,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.21,0:24:03.96,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}豪華な品も
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.05,0:24:05.76,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}派手な飾りも、
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.88,0:24:07.47,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.68,0:24:09.51,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}食卓囲もう
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.59,0:24:11.30,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}昨日のミスも
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:13.14,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}不安な明日も
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.27,0:24:14.31,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}添えて
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.68,0:24:16.81,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}ねぇ、いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.98,0:24:18.69,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}凝った味付けも
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.56,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}シャレた盛り付けも、
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.65,0:24:22.27,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.52,0:24:24.28,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}涙の味はも
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:26.07,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}しょっぱいとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.19,0:24:28.07,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}最後にいつも
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.11,0:24:31.45,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}笑えたら
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.66,0:24:34.74,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}それがスパイス
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:18.63,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}明明放棄比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:22.59,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}明明想著不要做了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:25.93,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但是卻連逃開也做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:29.60,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}搖搖晃晃  搖搖晃晃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:33.39,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}因為缺乏自信
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.77,0:23:37.35,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不會好好表達自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:40.82,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在丟失了自信的螺旋裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.40,0:23:44.53,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一圈一圈  一圈一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.11,0:23:50.87,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但是已經相遇了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.49,0:23:57.71,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不會再弄丟了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.54,0:24:00.46,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只要有了笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:02.13,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.21,0:24:03.96,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}豪華的餐品也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.05,0:24:05.76,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}華麗的裝飾也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.88,0:24:07.47,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.68,0:24:09.51,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}餐桌上已經
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.59,0:24:11.30,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}昨天的錯誤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:13.14,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不安的明天也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.27,0:24:14.31,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}全部擺上了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.68,0:24:16.81,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}呐  多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.98,0:24:18.69,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}凝固的調料也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.56,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}精美的裝盤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.65,0:24:22.27,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.52,0:24:24.28,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}眼淚的味道已經
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:26.07,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就算變得鹹鹹的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.19,0:24:28.07,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}最後也會一直
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.11,0:24:31.45,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}微笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.66,0:24:34.74,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這就是調味品
